data: {"id": "b4087acdf5664369-thinking-parallel_evidence-1704", "run_id": "b4087acdf5664369", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "Let me analyze the evidence collected for Pod `workload-5c9c7b6489-fl85h` in namespace `aiops-case-08`.\n\n**Kubernetes Resource Facts (kubectl_get_yaml, kubectl_describe, kubectl_events):**\n- Pod phase: Running (but container not ready)\n- Container `app` status: CrashLoopBackOff, restarts=8, exitCode=137, last state=OOMKilled\n- Memory limit: 64Mi (from context archive)\n- Events: BackOff warning (x82 over 25m), indicating persistent crash-restart loop\n- Owner: ReplicaSet/workload-5c9c7b6489\n- Node", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 4, "ts_ms": 1788451044423, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

